"\n\n\n\n\n## Review\nA book where you can receive comfort through words that are simpler than expected and helpful in reality when you're having a hard time.  \nA book for F, not T.  \n\nIf you read it in a difficult situation, there will be one or two words among the simple words Winnie-the-Pooh delivers that can comfort you.  \nA good book to flick through again every now and then.  \n\nYou're not happy every day, but there are happy things every day.  "